what is the information
included in the WCAG guidelines.

00:34:36.336 --> 00:34:41.359
So based on the different
success criteria that we have,

00:34:41.384 --> 00:34:47.295
we also have some specific sections that
we can find a scenario they are looking to

00:34:48.304 --> 00:34:52.198
solve, when when we have
users with these kind of abilities

00:34:52.223 --> 00:34:55.711
or using a specific type
of assistive technology.

